<title>HONG KONG: HK stock exchange appoints listing exec director.</title>
<headline>HK stock exchange appoints listing exec director.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-01-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Stock Exchange of Hong Kong said on Wednesday it appointed Lawrence Fok as executive director, listing, with effect from January 23.</p>
<p>Fok, formerly a director of the listing division, will also serve as secretary to the listing committee, the exchange said in a statement.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6590</p>
</text>
